(6702186, 1002603, 142483, '<td valign="top">fantastic! only seen a few so far whilst voting, but this is the first I''ve seen where it actually looks like levitating, perhaps because the subject is doing something other than just gazing off into the distance... nice work. Technically, I find the colours to be a bit bland, but the photo meets the challenge and that was a challenge in itself!</td>', 'fantastic! only seen a few so far whilst voting, but this is the first I''ve seen where it actually looks like levitating, perhaps because the subject is doing something other than just gazing off into the distance... nice work. Technically, I find the colours to be a bit bland, but the photo meets the challenge and that was a challenge in itself!', '2012-03-07 00:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
