(6702230, 1002394, 142483, '<td valign="top">I think if the legs had been closer together it would look more like levitating. It''s a very nice image technically, and the editing is great, but looks too much like jumping. Still giving it a good score though, for making a genuine effort to enter a very well taken shot, in amongst some very random entrants... lol :)</td>', 'I think if the legs had been closer together it would look more like levitating. It''s a very nice image technically, and the editing is great, but looks too much like jumping. Still giving it a good score though, for making a genuine effort to enter a very well taken shot, in amongst some very random entrants... lol :)', '2012-03-07 00:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
