(6702360, 1002765, 114233, '<td valign="top">I hope this was a standing jump and not a running jump - because if you ran, jumped and slipped... well you didn''t so lets not worry about it then :-)<br/> <br/>Lovely setting and I hope you enjoyed every minute of the wonderful opportunity and spending the time with someone special was an added bonus!<br/> <br/>As for crit on the pic - not much. Maybe just that your right arm looks a bit red to me but comp and exposure etc is very nice. Well done.</td>', 'I hope this was a standing jump and not a running jump - because if you ran, jumped and slipped... well you didn''t so lets not worry about it then :-) Lovely setting and I hope you enjoyed every minute of the wonderful opportunity and spending the time with someone special was an added bonus! As for crit on the pic - not much. Maybe just that your right arm looks a bit red to me but comp and exposure etc is very nice. Well done.', '2012-03-07 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
