(6702945, 1002818, 96574, '<td valign="top">The best of the bunch I think.</td>', 'The best of the bunch I think.', '2012-03-07 14:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702947, 1002879, 96574, '<td valign="top">I like that her expression looks natural. Interesting how you used the background to create a border too.</td>', 'I like that her expression looks natural. Interesting how you used the background to create a border too.', '2012-03-07 14:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702949, 1002822, 96574, '<td valign="top">Nice processing. Sort of whimsical which fits the challenge perfectly</td>', 'Nice processing. Sort of whimsical which fits the challenge perfectly', '2012-03-07 14:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702984, 1002219, 142473, '<td valign="top">Well done with this one.  Looks like a quiet stroll.  I realized after I finished shooting that the KEY is pointing the toes, and your model got that down pat.</td>', 'Well done with this one.  Looks like a quiet stroll.  I realized after I finished shooting that the KEY is pointing the toes, and your model got that down pat.', '2012-03-07 14:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702985, 1002815, 142473, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and scene.  What''s that in your hand?!  A remote?!  Hehe.<br/> <br/>Looks like a beautiful place.</td>', 'Nice composition and scene.  What''s that in your hand?!  A remote?!  Hehe. Looks like a beautiful place.', '2012-03-07 14:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702987, 1002320, 142473, '<td valign="top">Not a bad attempt.  Shutter speed wasn''t high enough though, as there is some motion blur on the feet.<br/> <br/>Not sure what she''s doing though... what is she reaching for?</td>', 'Not a bad attempt.  Shutter speed wasn''t high enough though, as there is some motion blur on the feet. Not sure what she''s doing though... what is she reaching for?', '2012-03-07 14:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702988, 1002670, 142473, '<td valign="top">Jumping Jehoshaphats!  Cool capture!  Right place at the right time eh?</td>', 'Jumping Jehoshaphats!  Cool capture!  Right place at the right time eh?', '2012-03-07 14:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702991, 1002822, 142473, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition, but I''m not a fan of the color tones.  Looks like some sort of HDR coloring was used?  I don''t think the effect helps the image.</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition, but I''m not a fan of the color tones.  Looks like some sort of HDR coloring was used?  I don''t think the effect helps the image.', '2012-03-07 15:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702994, 1002818, 142473, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and setting.  Good back lighting.  I think it could have been a stronger image if the top 33% of the image was cropped out though.</td>', 'Nice composition and setting.  Good back lighting.  I think it could have been a stronger image if the top 33% of the image was cropped out though.', '2012-03-07 15:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702995, 1002731, 142473, '<td valign="top">While she is cute - try again.</td>', 'While she is cute - try again.', '2012-03-07 15:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702996, 1002845, 142473, '<td valign="top">That is quite a leap.<br/> <br/>Motion blur is a negative on these images.  Also looks like you forgot to color correct in post?  That would add a lot more drama.</td>', 'That is quite a leap. Motion blur is a negative on these images.  Also looks like you forgot to color correct in post?  That would add a lot more drama.', '2012-03-07 15:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702998, 1002538, 142473, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Love the blues in the BG.  My only qualm is that the position doesn''t look very natural.  Head up would have been a little better.  I also see a little blur on the legs.  A little higher shutter could have helped.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Love the blues in the BG.  My only qualm is that the position doesn''t look very natural.  Head up would have been a little better.  I also see a little blur on the legs.  A little higher shutter could have helped.', '2012-03-07 15:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6702999, 1002785, 142473, '<td valign="top">That looks painful.</td>', 'That looks painful.', '2012-03-07 15:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703000, 1002822, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the processing in this photo.  The capture is great... it looks like she is floating through the air.  Nice lighting as well.  Beautifully executed!</td>', 'Love the processing in this photo.  The capture is great... it looks like she is floating through the air.  Nice lighting as well.  Beautifully executed!', '2012-03-07 15:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703001, 1002836, 142473, '<td valign="top">Nice illusion!  Looks quite comfy.  If the wall outlet could have been hidden better, might have added a little more to the illusion.  One of my favorites from this challenge though!</td>', 'Nice illusion!  Looks quite comfy.  If the wall outlet could have been hidden better, might have added a little more to the illusion.  One of my favorites from this challenge though!', '2012-03-07 15:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703003, 1002837, 142473, '<td valign="top">Flash is way too harsh here, and kinda ruins any illusion of floating.</td>', 'Flash is way too harsh here, and kinda ruins any illusion of floating.', '2012-03-07 15:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703005, 1002829, 142473, '<td valign="top">Time to let the dog out!  You captured the float very well.<br/> <br/>I almost thought of a wizard living out in the wild on his own in a shack deep in the woods... then I saw the homes in the BG.</td>', 'Time to let the dog out!  You captured the float very well. I almost thought of a wizard living out in the wild on his own in a shack deep in the woods... then I saw the homes in the BG.', '2012-03-07 15:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703007, 1002643, 142473, '<td valign="top">Two people makes it twice as hard eh?  I think each pose is pretty good, but maybe not right together.  I''m not generally a fan of sepia images, but all in all, it''s a solid shot.</td>', 'Two people makes it twice as hard eh?  I think each pose is pretty good, but maybe not right together.  I''m not generally a fan of sepia images, but all in all, it''s a solid shot.', '2012-03-07 15:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703011, 1002879, 142473, '<td valign="top">Cool crop with the built in border.  The motion blur in the hair is the only issue with the illusion.</td>', 'Cool crop with the built in border.  The motion blur in the hair is the only issue with the illusion.', '2012-03-07 15:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703012, 1002295, 142473, '<td valign="top">Pose is right in this one.  Subject is a little blown out, but otherwise a solid illusion!</td>', 'Pose is right in this one.  Subject is a little blown out, but otherwise a solid illusion!', '2012-03-07 15:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703014, 1001678, 142473, '<td valign="top">Love the rockies!  This shot captures the freedom of the mountains eh?  Not exactly a floating illusion, but a cool picture anyway of what I''m sure was a fun day.</td>', 'Love the rockies!  This shot captures the freedom of the mountains eh?  Not exactly a floating illusion, but a cool picture anyway of what I''m sure was a fun day.', '2012-03-07 15:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703015, 1002838, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Love the post processing done here... gives it an "older" feeling.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Love the post processing done here... gives it an "older" feeling.', '2012-03-07 15:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703018, 1002798, 134859, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  Love the colors, the sharpness, and the "levitating" feel.  Great job!</td>', 'Awesome shot.  Love the colors, the sharpness, and the "levitating" feel.  Great job!', '2012-03-07 15:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703019, 1002190, 134859, '<td valign="top">Absolutely amazing angle!  I love this!  Definite "levitating" feel here!  Nice conversion to black and white as well</td>', 'Absolutely amazing angle!  I love this!  Definite "levitating" feel here!  Nice conversion to black and white as well', '2012-03-07 15:14:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6703021, 1002671, 134859, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Love how it has the appearance of "floating through the air".  And awesome title!  Very fitting.  The direct sunlight is a little harsh, but overall, this is a great composition!  :)</td>', 'Cool shot.  Love how it has the appearance of "floating through the air".  And awesome title!  Very fitting.  The direct sunlight is a little harsh, but overall, this is a great composition!  :)', '2012-03-07 15:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703024, 1002836, 134859, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Seems like it would have been difficult to achieve.  Can''t wait to read the photographer''s comments on this shot.  <br/>There is also a "dreamy" feel to this photo, which is very fitting, given the message being conveyed here.  Great job levitating!</td>', 'Great shot!  Seems like it would have been difficult to achieve.  Can''t wait to read the photographer''s comments on this shot.  There is also a "dreamy" feel to this photo, which is very fitting, given the message being conveyed here.  Great job levitating!', '2012-03-07 15:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703026, 1002643, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Love the colors!  Great post processing.  Almost looks like there is a little haloing, but perhaps it''s from me looking at the computer for too long.  It''s a great shot, nonetheless!</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Love the colors!  Great post processing.  Almost looks like there is a little haloing, but perhaps it''s from me looking at the computer for too long.  It''s a great shot, nonetheless!', '2012-03-07 15:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703027, 1002295, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the shot.  It''s a little overexposed, however.  But you nailed the "levitating" look!</td>', 'Love the shot.  It''s a little overexposed, however.  But you nailed the "levitating" look!', '2012-03-07 15:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703029, 1001678, 134859, '<td valign="top">More of "jumping" rather than levitating, though the challenge does state "leap", so it''s open for interpretation.  <br/>The lighting is a little harsh, and there''s shadowing on the faces, which takes away from the photo.  But that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'More of "jumping" rather than levitating, though the challenge does state "leap", so it''s open for interpretation.  The lighting is a little harsh, and there''s shadowing on the faces, which takes away from the photo.  But that''s just my opinion.', '2012-03-07 15:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703032, 1002463, 134859, '<td valign="top">DIRTY FEET!  LOL.  But an awesome shot.  Love the levitating look here, like she''s walking through the air.  Great job and love the post processing!</td>', 'DIRTY FEET!  LOL.  But an awesome shot.  Love the levitating look here, like she''s walking through the air.  Great job and love the post processing!', '2012-03-07 15:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703036, 1002868, 134859, '<td valign="top">Great processing, and lovely capture!  Love the look here.  And the notepad and pencil add an awesome touch.</td>', 'Great processing, and lovely capture!  Love the look here.  And the notepad and pencil add an awesome touch.', '2012-03-07 15:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703041, 1002752, 142473, '<td valign="top">Not a bad capture.  I see blur in the feet which hurts the illusion, but overall a cool idea!</td>', 'Not a bad capture.  I see blur in the feet which hurts the illusion, but overall a cool idea!', '2012-03-07 15:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703042, 1002673, 134859, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot!  LOVE LOVE LOVE the processing here.  Nice sharpness and great capture!  GREAT job!  10</td>', 'Amazing shot!  LOVE LOVE LOVE the processing here.  Nice sharpness and great capture!  GREAT job!  10', '2012-03-07 15:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703045, 1002870, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot.  Love the idea captured here.  The lighting is a little off, but overall, this is great!</td>', 'This is a lovely shot.  Love the idea captured here.  The lighting is a little off, but overall, this is great!', '2012-03-07 15:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703046, 1002749, 142473, '<td valign="top">I like that the BG is exposed properly, and the foreground with your pretty model is in the dark.  The biggest improvement I can muster would have been to crop out the homes in the BG.  They tend to steal my eye''s focus away from your model.</td>', 'I like that the BG is exposed properly, and the foreground with your pretty model is in the dark.  The biggest improvement I can muster would have been to crop out the homes in the BG.  They tend to steal my eye''s focus away from your model.', '2012-03-07 15:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703048, 1002645, 142473, '<td valign="top">Something about this makes me smile... although the illusion isn''t really there.</td>', 'Something about this makes me smile... although the illusion isn''t really there.', '2012-03-07 15:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703049, 1002751, 134859, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  Definitely has the appearance of levitation!  Nice black and white and focus!</td>', 'Awesome shot.  Definitely has the appearance of levitation!  Nice black and white and focus!', '2012-03-07 15:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703052, 1002596, 142473, '<td valign="top">This image brought to you by CANNON!  Hehe!</td>', 'This image brought to you by CANNON!  Hehe!', '2012-03-07 15:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703053, 1002689, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is probably my favorite of the bunch!  The look is so amazing realistic.  The appearance of levitation is perfectly executed here!  WONDERFUL SHOT!  10.</td>', 'This is probably my favorite of the bunch!  The look is so amazing realistic.  The appearance of levitation is perfectly executed here!  WONDERFUL SHOT!  10.', '2012-03-07 15:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703057, 1002838, 142473, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites from the challenge... probably my favorite.  Good simple pose.  Love that the toast is floating too.  No motion blur.  Very cute model.  However, I''m seeing a bit too much purple in the color mix.  Still a high scorer in my mind.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites from the challenge... probably my favorite.  Good simple pose.  Love that the toast is floating too.  No motion blur.  Very cute model.  However, I''m seeing a bit too much purple in the color mix.  Still a high scorer in my mind.', '2012-03-07 15:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703058, 1002603, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, has the appearance of levitation.</td>', 'Nice capture, has the appearance of levitation.', '2012-03-07 15:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703062, 1002175, 134859, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  love the colors.  cute title.  there''s a little too much shadow on the model''s face for my liking, but overall, this is a great image.</td>', 'Great shot.  love the colors.  cute title.  there''s a little too much shadow on the model''s face for my liking, but overall, this is a great image.', '2012-03-07 15:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703064, 1002686, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Looks like levitation to me.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Looks like levitation to me.', '2012-03-07 15:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703065, 1002817, 134859, '<td valign="top">Extremely saturated photo... but nice levitation shot.</td>', 'Extremely saturated photo... but nice levitation shot.', '2012-03-07 15:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703067, 1002728, 142473, '<td valign="top">Cute model, but it doesn''t make up for the poor setting, setup, and lack of color editing.</td>', 'Cute model, but it doesn''t make up for the poor setting, setup, and lack of color editing.', '2012-03-07 15:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703069, 1002818, 134859, '<td valign="top">Eerie shot.  I like that.  Nice levitation, awesome shadowing.. wonderful!</td>', 'Eerie shot.  I like that.  Nice levitation, awesome shadowing.. wonderful!', '2012-03-07 15:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703070, 1002862, 134859, '<td valign="top">Great levitation look... the model looks a bit scared?</td>', 'Great levitation look... the model looks a bit scared?', '2012-03-07 15:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703072, 1002870, 142473, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture.  If you did this by jumping only, I''m very impressed.  You''ve got a very talented jumper.  I''m guessing you used a suspension of some sort to get this one?  Very nice illusion.  This will do well.</td>', 'Lovely capture.  If you did this by jumping only, I''m very impressed.  You''ve got a very talented jumper.  I''m guessing you used a suspension of some sort to get this one?  Very nice illusion.  This will do well.', '2012-03-07 15:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703073, 1002756, 134859, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  Love the look, the angle, the extreme shadowing.  Nicely captured</td>', 'Awesome shot.  Love the look, the angle, the extreme shadowing.  Nicely captured', '2012-03-07 15:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703074, 1002359, 142473, '<td valign="top">Beware of the flying best man!</td>', 'Beware of the flying best man!', '2012-03-07 15:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703075, 1002300, 134859, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Love the colors, the sharpness is nice.  The look of levitation is there.  Great capture!</td>', 'Great shot!  Love the colors, the sharpness is nice.  The look of levitation is there.  Great capture!', '2012-03-07 15:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703079, 1002739, 142473, '<td valign="top">Read your friend''s comment... same image, same comment...</td>', 'Read your friend''s comment... same image, same comment...', '2012-03-07 15:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703081, 1002219, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  The levitation is good.  The only thing I don''t like about the shot is the look on the models face.  Other than that, it''s a good photo.</td>', 'Nice capture.  The levitation is good.  The only thing I don''t like about the shot is the look on the models face.  Other than that, it''s a good photo.', '2012-03-07 15:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703086, 1002538, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  The shot is an awkward pose, but it works pretty well.  Nice DOF, the only thing I would have liked to see different is the foot at the top, and the hand at the bottom more in focus.  Also, the lighting on the lower back is a little bright.  Other than that, it''s a wonderful capture!  :)</td>', 'Love the title.  The shot is an awkward pose, but it works pretty well.  Nice DOF, the only thing I would have liked to see different is the foot at the top, and the hand at the bottom more in focus.  Also, the lighting on the lower back is a little bright.  Other than that, it''s a wonderful capture!  :)', '2012-03-07 15:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703089, 1002394, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like the shot.  The processing is well done.  I think if the legs were together, rather than apart, it would have given more of an appearance of levitation.  But a well done photo!</td>', 'I like the shot.  The processing is well done.  I think if the legs were together, rather than apart, it would have given more of an appearance of levitation.  But a well done photo!', '2012-03-07 15:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
