(6703394, 1002742, 10785, '<td valign="top">This person was a popular model for this challenge! Well, you sized your entry so it was large enough to see clearly. You did a decent job with keeping the background simple without a lot of clutter. You could stand to further enhance the picture using your post processing software to add a little more contrast and bump up the color saturation a bit more... The only other comment would be to study the style of the photographer this challenge was about a bit more. Her style is more about levitation, and you have clearly shown leaping! Nice job overall.</td>', 'This person was a popular model for this challenge! Well, you sized your entry so it was large enough to see clearly. You did a decent job with keeping the background simple without a lot of clutter. You could stand to further enhance the picture using your post processing software to add a little more contrast and bump up the color saturation a bit more... The only other comment would be to study the style of the photographer this challenge was about a bit more. Her style is more about levitation, and you have clearly shown leaping! Nice job overall.', '2012-03-07 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703396, 1002463, 10785, '<td valign="top">Lovely light here with a very interesting set up.</td>', 'Lovely light here with a very interesting set up.', '2012-03-07 19:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703403, 1002304, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice job on capturing the levitation. Good color and contrast, but could stand to be a tad brighter to show off more of the detail in the dark clothing. Keep watch on the backgrounds to ensure they are clean and clutter free. Here the trees appear to be growing out of her head which is somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Nice job on capturing the levitation. Good color and contrast, but could stand to be a tad brighter to show off more of the detail in the dark clothing. Keep watch on the backgrounds to ensure they are clean and clutter free. Here the trees appear to be growing out of her head which is somewhat distracting.', '2012-03-07 19:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
