(6703904, 1002620, 143659, '<td valign="top">This is cool. It looks like your a giant tip-toeing across this small defenseless city, making sure not to break anything. I think this would of looked a little more like "superman looking/flying over metropolis" if the angle could of been higher on Anna.</td>', 'This is cool. It looks like your a giant tip-toeing across this small defenseless city, making sure not to break anything. I think this would of looked a little more like "superman looking/flying over metropolis" if the angle could of been higher on Anna.', '2012-03-08 01:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703920, 1002724, 143659, '<td valign="top">I like your pose. The idea is to leap but make it look as if your flying or levitating. So keeping your body and face relaxed a must. You have a blur to the picture, you can fix that by turning up your shutter speed. Remember that by doing this your shutter will be closing faster, letting in less light.</td>', 'I like your pose. The idea is to leap but make it look as if your flying or levitating. So keeping your body and face relaxed a must. You have a blur to the picture, you can fix that by turning up your shutter speed. Remember that by doing this your shutter will be closing faster, letting in less light.', '2012-03-08 01:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703925, 1002722, 143659, '<td valign="top">Your almost vertical with the ground... Hope you landed on your feet! I might of tried to jump towards the camera to help with the blur. I''m not sure if your able to adjust your shutter speed with your camera but you you should be able to change the mode that your shooting from single to multi, that might also help.</td>', 'Your almost vertical with the ground... Hope you landed on your feet! I might of tried to jump towards the camera to help with the blur. I''m not sure if your able to adjust your shutter speed with your camera but you you should be able to change the mode that your shooting from single to multi, that might also help.', '2012-03-08 01:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6703931, 1002309, 143659, '<td valign="top">I feel so high above the ground looking at this. Would of been cool to see a person in a business suit with a brief case... and maybe a tie blowing back for movement.</td>', 'I feel so high above the ground looking at this. Would of been cool to see a person in a business suit with a brief case... and maybe a tie blowing back for movement.', '2012-03-08 01:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
