(6704263, 1002845, 132251, '<td valign="top">interesting concept, it looks like he is pretty high up there. <br/>If you used a faster shutter speed you would freeze the motion in his arms. I know a faster shutter speed would be hard in this case judging by the lack of light you had to wotrk with. It also seems that the focus is on the wall behind him, not totally on him. <br/>Good luck and keep snapping away</td>', 'interesting concept, it looks like he is pretty high up there. If you used a faster shutter speed you would freeze the motion in his arms. I know a faster shutter speed would be hard in this case judging by the lack of light you had to wotrk with. It also seems that the focus is on the wall behind him, not totally on him. Good luck and keep snapping away', '2012-03-08 10:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6704265, 1002837, 132251, '<td valign="top">just a few pointers, your subject is in the center of the frame, try to get him over to a third of the shot. Try to remove distracting elements, like the girl at the computer and the TV and such. Instead of pointing the flash right at the subject, point it at the ceiling or a wall to soften the shadows. <br/>Good luck and keep snapping!!</td>', 'just a few pointers, your subject is in the center of the frame, try to get him over to a third of the shot. Try to remove distracting elements, like the girl at the computer and the TV and such. Instead of pointing the flash right at the subject, point it at the ceiling or a wall to soften the shadows. Good luck and keep snapping!!', '2012-03-08 10:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
