(6704319, 1002830, 132251, '<td valign="top">I am curious on how you got the bright light on her, it looks like sunlight but nothing else is illuminated like that (except for that little patch in the road on the right). well done</td>', 'I am curious on how you got the bright light on her, it looks like sunlight but nothing else is illuminated like that (except for that little patch in the road on the right). well done', '2012-03-08 11:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
