(6705338, 1002295, 124190, '<td valign="top">This works enough to get me looking.....expression is mostly removed....angle is good...subject and outfit interesting....the only thing that could have been better IMHO would be to dodge out the shadow and maybe ramp up the blacks.....</td>', 'This works enough to get me looking.....expression is mostly removed....angle is good...subject and outfit interesting....the only thing that could have been better IMHO would be to dodge out the shadow and maybe ramp up the blacks.....', '2012-03-09 10:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705341, 1002866, 124190, '<td valign="top">geezzz............lol.....what happened to it''s eyes.....omg I love this.</td>', 'geezzz............lol.....what happened to it''s eyes.....omg I love this.', '2012-03-09 10:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705346, 1002869, 124190, '<td valign="top">Like the composition....half person thing...lines etc....high score....IMO it would have been way more eerie if you would have dodged out the person''s shadows. But what do I know....(now that I look at it more that would be almost too time consuming...) just pondering here......someone has STRONG arms!!!!! This keeps my attention....... for a long time... best shot in the bunch.</td>', 'Like the composition....half person thing...lines etc....high score....IMO it would have been way more eerie if you would have dodged out the person''s shadows. But what do I know....(now that I look at it more that would be almost too time consuming...) just pondering here......someone has STRONG arms!!!!! This keeps my attention....... for a long time... best shot in the bunch.', '2012-03-09 11:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705352, 1002463, 124190, '<td valign="top">Can''t help but comment....catches my attention.....glad there isn''t a shadow on the floor....can''t decide if her feet should have been scrubbed or not.....lolol.....I think maybe......cuz that''s all I keep staring at now......but one can never tell in this DPC land....things can go many ways...interpretation etc....intention et all.....that really has me tied up.....I picture her with dark gray ballerina type flats....   high mark.</td>', 'Can''t help but comment....catches my attention.....glad there isn''t a shadow on the floor....can''t decide if her feet should have been scrubbed or not.....lolol.....I think maybe......cuz that''s all I keep staring at now......but one can never tell in this DPC land....things can go many ways...interpretation etc....intention et all.....that really has me tied up.....I picture her with dark gray ballerina type flats....   high mark.', '2012-03-09 11:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705355, 1002870, 124190, '<td valign="top">I''m prejudice...I''m a painter...... looks like she''s contemplating traveling down the tunnel to see the Wizard.....   :-)</td>', 'I''m prejudice...I''m a painter...... looks like she''s contemplating traveling down the tunnel to see the Wizard.....   :-)', '2012-03-09 11:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705363, 1002190, 124190, '<td valign="top">I like this.........  darn it...you reminded me my house is a mess...... high mark.</td>', 'I like this.........  darn it...you reminded me my house is a mess...... high mark.', '2012-03-09 11:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705368, 1002670, 124190, '<td valign="top">GO BIRDIE GO!       LOVELY!   there is something beautifully innocent and captivating about this.     It''s strange how perfect the expression is....the framing....I am having an emotional reaction to this.    10</td>', 'GO BIRDIE GO!       LOVELY!   there is something beautifully innocent and captivating about this.     It''s strange how perfect the expression is....the framing....I am having an emotional reaction to this.    10', '2012-03-09 11:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705379, 1002879, 124190, '<td valign="top">Why does she look like she''s about to burst out laughing!   I WILL JOIN HER.....DELIGHTFUL!</td>', 'Why does she look like she''s about to burst out laughing!   I WILL JOIN HER.....DELIGHTFUL!', '2012-03-09 11:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6705387, 1002822, 124190, '<td valign="top">I love the soft edges, pose and tree........the roof line and drain pipe look like they are impaling your head....it''s one of those things you might overlook that is glaring in other people''s faces....(unless you left it there on purpose??)... especially when you have spent so much time processing the other parts of the picture to get the mood you''d like.   PICK PICK PICK&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; I''ve starting to make suggestions which people may hate so I say what other''s do...IMHO........to start a critique....rather than to say one word.....like "distracting" or some such sting.....I hope, when I start doing this people understand that I am not being negative...only lending a different point of view...literally.... so  assuming you either had someone else take the shot or set up a tripod....you may have wanted to try to get a shot of her (you?) closer to the tree and farther down towards the center.......ug.  I should stop.  I just think this has potential.    What do you think?</td>', 'I love the soft edges, pose and tree........the roof line and drain pipe look like they are impaling your head....it''s one of those things you might overlook that is glaring in other people''s faces....(unless you left it there on purpose??)... especially when you have spent so much time processing the other parts of the picture to get the mood you''d like.   PICK PICK PICK>>>>>>>>> I''ve starting to make suggestions which people may hate so I say what other''s do...IMHO........to start a critique....rather than to say one word.....like "distracting" or some such sting.....I hope, when I start doing this people understand that I am not being negative...only lending a different point of view...literally.... so  assuming you either had someone else take the shot or set up a tripod....you may have wanted to try to get a shot of her (you?) closer to the tree and farther down towards the center.......ug.  I should stop.  I just think this has potential.    What do you think?', '2012-03-09 11:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
