(6706141, 1002836, 117534, '<td valign="top">Wow.. how''d ya do this one??  My only clue is those two little peaky shadows on the wall, and I have NO idea what they are. If you fell from somewhere and landed on your side like this ...Ouch  Hope folks don''t get stuck in leaping is jumping in the air.. I think this is new and refreshing take on the challenge +++ points for thinking out of the box</td>', 'Wow.. how''d ya do this one??  My only clue is those two little peaky shadows on the wall, and I have NO idea what they are. If you fell from somewhere and landed on your side like this ...Ouch  Hope folks don''t get stuck in leaping is jumping in the air.. I think this is new and refreshing take on the challenge +++ points for thinking out of the box', '2012-03-10 11:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
