(6706165, 1002309, 138630, '<td valign="top">Probably my favorite of the challenge because of the background - could be too busy but because of the repeated lines and shapes, the tones, and the softness is not.  I love that it looks as if he is incredibly high, too.  Were you on a roof?  I MIGHT have liked it better had the perspective placed his face against that open area between the buildings, but then again maybe not.</td>', 'Probably my favorite of the challenge because of the background - could be too busy but because of the repeated lines and shapes, the tones, and the softness is not.  I love that it looks as if he is incredibly high, too.  Were you on a roof?  I MIGHT have liked it better had the perspective placed his face against that open area between the buildings, but then again maybe not.', '2012-03-10 13:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6706166, 1002648, 138630, '<td valign="top">Makes me smile every time I look at it and bravo for these guys who almost all kept a straight face while doing this - something I would have been unable to do :)  The group levitation works particularly well here, I think.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'Makes me smile every time I look at it and bravo for these guys who almost all kept a straight face while doing this - something I would have been unable to do :)  The group levitation works particularly well here, I think.  One of my top picks.', '2012-03-10 13:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6706167, 1002879, 138630, '<td valign="top">Terrific "pose" and expression as well as lighting.  Love the umbrella, too.  Not sure about the shade.  Part of me likes it because it''s so non-distracting and part of me doesn''t like it because it''s boring.  Hummmmm - says more about me than the photo :)  Still one of my top picks.</td>', 'Terrific "pose" and expression as well as lighting.  Love the umbrella, too.  Not sure about the shade.  Part of me likes it because it''s so non-distracting and part of me doesn''t like it because it''s boring.  Hummmmm - says more about me than the photo :)  Still one of my top picks.', '2012-03-10 13:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
