(6706780, 1002811, 81362, '<td valign="top">Dog seems to be preparing to land. Catching while going up or at peak of leap would work better. Consider repeating to be able to see the dog''s face. If doing again, consider selecting a setting with less clutter -- while you look at the subject, the camera looks at everything that is present.</td>', 'Dog seems to be preparing to land. Catching while going up or at peak of leap would work better. Consider repeating to be able to see the dog''s face. If doing again, consider selecting a setting with less clutter -- while you look at the subject, the camera looks at everything that is present.', '2012-03-11 10:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6706783, 1002702, 81362, '<td valign="top">Subject appears to be standing on the floor rather than being in mid-air, so seems to miss being the type of image requested for this topic.</td>', 'Subject appears to be standing on the floor rather than being in mid-air, so seems to miss being the type of image requested for this topic.', '2012-03-11 10:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6706786, 1002703, 81362, '<td valign="top">The gesture suggests being in the air. Having the image include the feet would make it visually more convincing. Your subject has a good expression that conveys enthusasim. Making the picture in a setting without background clutter would help the viewer appreciate it more.</td>', 'The gesture suggests being in the air. Having the image include the feet would make it visually more convincing. Your subject has a good expression that conveys enthusasim. Making the picture in a setting without background clutter would help the viewer appreciate it more.', '2012-03-11 10:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6706787, 1002723, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice to see the feet and get a sense of being in the air. A bit of post processing to make the building level, sharpen slightly, boost contrast, and re-size to the allowed 800 pix width could help a lot.</td>', 'Nice to see the feet and get a sense of being in the air. A bit of post processing to make the building level, sharpen slightly, boost contrast, and re-size to the allowed 800 pix width could help a lot.', '2012-03-11 10:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6706789, 1002718, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good catch of the golf club at the peak of action, although hard to be visually convincing that this was during an active swing rather than static pose. If this included a jump off the ground, it is even better, but the visual impression is of standing on the grass. If an actual leap, would need to shoot from low down to better show the gap between shoes and ground.</td>', 'Good catch of the golf club at the peak of action, although hard to be visually convincing that this was during an active swing rather than static pose. If this included a jump off the ground, it is even better, but the visual impression is of standing on the grass. If an actual leap, would need to shoot from low down to better show the gap between shoes and ground.', '2012-03-11 10:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
