(6708055, 1002363, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good idea, and really nice timing. I wonder how much wine you needed to clean off the carpet.<br/> <br/>If you don''t mind, I have some suggestions that could possibly take this to the next level:<br/>* Overall the photo seems a bit dark. More light could help show the details<br/>* There are some definite shadows cast from what I assume is a flash. These shadows are distracting<br/>* I feel like the lady is looking into space, where if she were looking at the glass or the man, that might be more realistic<br/>* The guy''s jeans don''t seem to fit with the rest of their clothes.<br/> <br/>I hope this helps!</td>', 'Good idea, and really nice timing. I wonder how much wine you needed to clean off the carpet. If you don''t mind, I have some suggestions that could possibly take this to the next level:* Overall the photo seems a bit dark. More light could help show the details* There are some definite shadows cast from what I assume is a flash. These shadows are distracting* I feel like the lady is looking into space, where if she were looking at the glass or the man, that might be more realistic* The guy''s jeans don''t seem to fit with the rest of their clothes. I hope this helps!', '2012-03-12 14:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
