(6708547, 1002870, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great shot, addresses the challenge wonderfully. I love the rich colour provided by the painting, and the dramatic lighting. One of my two 10s, hope to see it ribbon.</td>', 'Great shot, addresses the challenge wonderfully. I love the rich colour provided by the painting, and the dramatic lighting. One of my two 10s, hope to see it ribbon.', '2012-03-13 02:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708578, 1002822, 97225, '<td valign="top">I really think you''ve done a great job with the leap and capturing that, and I love the processing. The lines of the roof behind your head keep this out of my top 3. (I''m assuming this is a self-portrait, Sophia?) I''ve given you 8, and that means I consider it to be at least top 10 in this challenge.</td>', 'I really think you''ve done a great job with the leap and capturing that, and I love the processing. The lines of the roof behind your head keep this out of my top 3. (I''m assuming this is a self-portrait, Sophia?) I''ve given you 8, and that means I consider it to be at least top 10 in this challenge.', '2012-03-13 03:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708579, 1002648, 97225, '<td valign="top">Cool getting them all of the ground together. 8</td>', 'Cool getting them all of the ground together. 8', '2012-03-13 03:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708581, 1002644, 97225, '<td valign="top">Quirky, I like it.</td>', 'Quirky, I like it.', '2012-03-13 03:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708628, 1002363, 14001, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, very intriguing how you executed the shot, love that!  Don''t love how the man is wearing mis-matching clothes with the woman, and the harsh flash shadow lines.  Maybe shoot on a porch in the evening if all you have is an on-camera flash.  Very creative though!!  Nine for that!</td>', 'Interesting concept, very intriguing how you executed the shot, love that!  Don''t love how the man is wearing mis-matching clothes with the woman, and the harsh flash shadow lines.  Maybe shoot on a porch in the evening if all you have is an on-camera flash.  Very creative though!!  Nine for that!', '2012-03-13 08:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708631, 1002309, 14001, '<td valign="top">really creative!  Love the angles.  Little movement in the hands, so I give it a nine:)</td>', 'really creative!  Love the angles.  Little movement in the hands, so I give it a nine:)', '2012-03-13 08:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
