(6708640, 1002648, 14001, '<td valign="top">Is this a real shot?  If it is you did something wrong because it looks like two separate images, which is against the rules I think.  If they all did jump in unison , you over did the post processing.  Nice idea though, very unique!!</td>', 'Is this a real shot?  If it is you did something wrong because it looks like two separate images, which is against the rules I think.  If they all did jump in unison , you over did the post processing.  Nice idea though, very unique!!', '2012-03-13 08:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
