(6708642, 1002868, 14001, '<td valign="top">I live the colors and idea of the shot, but she looks jumping to me from her feet point down and the bag flying from her body.  Still like it though, the soft reds are very attractive and not over-the-top.</td>', 'I live the colors and idea of the shot, but she looks jumping to me from her feet point down and the bag flying from her body.  Still like it though, the soft reds are very attractive and not over-the-top.', '2012-03-13 08:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708644, 1002862, 14001, '<td valign="top">Props to the model for doing this for you!  I like the boots and snow.  I wold have shot this with my subject shifted to the left and hide the bench.  Kind of removes the idea of the concept when its obvious she didn''t jump but stepped off a bench.  I still like how she posed, and the stop action is very good.</td>', 'Props to the model for doing this for you!  I like the boots and snow.  I wold have shot this with my subject shifted to the left and hide the bench.  Kind of removes the idea of the concept when its obvious she didn''t jump but stepped off a bench.  I still like how she posed, and the stop action is very good.', '2012-03-13 08:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708646, 1002673, 14001, '<td valign="top">I like the soft colors and the model did an excellent job for you.  There''s so much to look at in this image, that at first glance I didn''t appreciate it as much as I do looking at it again.  Her left foot is soft in focus, so you probably should have shot a bit faster, but I really like this image with the papers blowing in the back ground, looks like she just bought groceries....very nice!</td>', 'I like the soft colors and the model did an excellent job for you.  There''s so much to look at in this image, that at first glance I didn''t appreciate it as much as I do looking at it again.  Her left foot is soft in focus, so you probably should have shot a bit faster, but I really like this image with the papers blowing in the back ground, looks like she just bought groceries....very nice!', '2012-03-13 08:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708700, 1002838, 96664, '<td valign="top">Personal favorite from this challenge. I hope it wins. :)</td>', 'Personal favorite from this challenge. I hope it wins. :)', '2012-03-13 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708746, 1002569, 77196, '<td valign="top">Unfortunate conjunction of the top of the wall and his rear end - looks like he''s sitting on the wall, rather than hovering mid-air. Very nice position of hands and feet - nothing that conveys "shot while someone was jumping".</td>', 'Unfortunate conjunction of the top of the wall and his rear end - looks like he''s sitting on the wall, rather than hovering mid-air. Very nice position of hands and feet - nothing that conveys "shot while someone was jumping".', '2012-03-13 12:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708747, 1002870, 77196, '<td valign="top">This looks like in the style of tanguera. A bit too dark on the near side of her face - maybe even overall. Wish the red in the picture popped a bit more. Very nice positioning of the arms / hands &amp; legs / feet.</td>', 'This looks like in the style of tanguera. A bit too dark on the near side of her face - maybe even overall. Wish the red in the picture popped a bit more. Very nice positioning of the arms / hands & legs / feet.', '2012-03-13 12:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
