(6708753, 1002648, 77196, '<td valign="top">The Charge of the Light Brigade? I think only a military group could do this this well. The closest things to hinting at a jump are: the flag man''s feet (though it almost looks like he''s walking), the the shoulders of the guy nearside of the front row (though it almost looks like he''s just standing at attention). 10</td>', 'The Charge of the Light Brigade? I think only a military group could do this this well. The closest things to hinting at a jump are: the flag man''s feet (though it almost looks like he''s walking), the the shoulders of the guy nearside of the front row (though it almost looks like he''s just standing at attention). 10', '2012-03-13 12:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
