(6709711, 1002836, 138253, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, took me until the competition is closed to realize you are laying on the floor with the pillow/matress stacked against a wall. Painting is on the floor to give illusion of being on a wall.<br/> <br/>As for the comment about not sure how it meet the "leap" challenge, it was said "in the style of (someone)", their pictures denote people doing everyday activities while flying. This is an everyday activity and well thought out to depict "sleep flying". <br/> <br/>I still love this image, great job!</td>', 'Ahhh, took me until the competition is closed to realize you are laying on the floor with the pillow/matress stacked against a wall. Painting is on the floor to give illusion of being on a wall. As for the comment about not sure how it meet the "leap" challenge, it was said "in the style of (someone)", their pictures denote people doing everyday activities while flying. This is an everyday activity and well thought out to depict "sleep flying".  I still love this image, great job!', '2012-03-14 10:21:03.000000', NULL, 0),
