(6709721, 1002670, 121916, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image.  It is not staged, it is natural, and it is unusual.  I gave it a 10.  Shame that it didn''t rank higher, it certainly deserved it.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image.  It is not staged, it is natural, and it is unusual.  I gave it a 10.  Shame that it didn''t rank higher, it certainly deserved it.', '2012-03-14 10:33:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6709757, 1002838, 60173, '<td valign="top">Interesting. While it''s a good score, I''d expected this to place better. Not only do you have the subject levitating, but also the food. There''s a few ahead of you in the challenge that I feel are far weaker than this image. It should have easily been in the top 10.<br/> <br/>I must say though... push in that drawer! My husband leaves the cabinets open all the time. Drives me bonkers!</td>', 'Interesting. While it''s a good score, I''d expected this to place better. Not only do you have the subject levitating, but also the food. There''s a few ahead of you in the challenge that I feel are far weaker than this image. It should have easily been in the top 10. I must say though... push in that drawer! My husband leaves the cabinets open all the time. Drives me bonkers!', '2012-03-14 11:11:40.000000', NULL, 0),
