(6709831, 1002648, 112972, '<td valign="top">Mike, why did you decide to introduce such an excessive blur on the sky and the grass?  Obviously they were not present in the original image.  It just feels weird and unnatural this way.  How about the shadows?  Do they seem off because of the blur you introduced in the image?  Just curious why you chose to go down that route because the image just doesn''t look right to me.  Regardless, congrats on the blue.</td>', 'Mike, why did you decide to introduce such an excessive blur on the sky and the grass?  Obviously they were not present in the original image.  It just feels weird and unnatural this way.  How about the shadows?  Do they seem off because of the blur you introduced in the image?  Just curious why you chose to go down that route because the image just doesn''t look right to me.  Regardless, congrats on the blue.', '2012-03-14 12:20:26.000000', NULL, 0),
