(6709948, 1002603, 142599, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JamesDowning:</b></div><hr/><i> Man, I wish he were just a little bit higher, or a little bit further right... his feet match with a line of the bridge and disturbs the illusion a little.  Solid shot though, one of the best. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks , I honestly didn''t even notice the feet until you said it . Oops ! I''m very new at photography . LOL I will pay more attention to lines next time . Thank you for comment :)</td>', 'Originally posted by JamesDowning: Man, I wish he were just a little bit higher, or a little bit further right... his feet match with a line of the bridge and disturbs the illusion a little.  Solid shot though, one of the best.   Thanks , I honestly didn''t even notice the feet until you said it . Oops ! I''m very new at photography . LOL I will pay more attention to lines next time . Thank you for comment :)', '2012-03-14 15:06:03.000000', NULL, 0),
