(6710589, 1002648, 75713, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this image and chuckling every time .. there is something (to me) so comical about these men, part of the greatest military force on this planet, suspending themselves in air.  So fun, so well done and so very deserving of the blue ribbon. Congratulations!</td>', 'I keep coming back to this image and chuckling every time .. there is something (to me) so comical about these men, part of the greatest military force on this planet, suspending themselves in air.  So fun, so well done and so very deserving of the blue ribbon. Congratulations!', '2012-03-15 01:12:47.000000', NULL, 0),
