(6711093, 1002648, 129807, '<td valign="top">This has to be the 8th, 9th, 10th or 20th ish time I''ve looked at this - just a fantastic take on the challenge. Yeah, so the processing could be improved on this particular shot, but wth, who really notices it anyway when your eyes are riveted on this spectacle! And when you get it right, you REALLY get it right:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=984357" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1483/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_984357.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1483/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_984357.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1483/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_984357.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=993596" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1516/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_993596.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1516/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_993596.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1516/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_993596.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>and you''ve got a sense of humour to boot:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=979528" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1470/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_979528.jpg?1'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1470/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_979528.jpg?1'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1470/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_979528.jpg?1"/></a> <br/> <br/>Congratulations :)</td>', 'This has to be the 8th, 9th, 10th or 20th ish time I''ve looked at this - just a fantastic take on the challenge. Yeah, so the processing could be improved on this particular shot, but wth, who really notices it anyway when your eyes are riveted on this spectacle! And when you get it right, you REALLY get it right:    and you''ve got a sense of humour to boot:   Congratulations :)', '2012-03-15 11:14:23.000000', NULL, 0),
